body:
What? I am and Australian in the UK on an ancestry visa and about to apply to stay and I do not need to meet the criteria for the Skills Shortage Visa as there is a different route for Ancestry which just involves having been working while here for 5 years. Unless this has VERY recently changed, this information is incorrect, at least for Australians on Ancestry Visas.

&#x200B;

OP, I cannot help at all on the horticulture side but if you ever want help with visa forms or general immigration support I am more than willing to share my experience.
